e feat_noop (self) No-op start callback. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( watch_feature_t ), intent(inout) :: self procedure, public :: on_watch_list_built => feat_list_noop private  subroutine feat_list_noop (self, files, roots) No-op watch-list callback; overrides must preserve file/root alignment with engine masks. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name class( watch_feature_t ), intent(inout) :: self type(string_t), intent(inout), allocatable :: files (:) Accepted path list; overrides must preserve alignment with the engine-owned per-file masks. type( root_info_t ), intent(inout), allocatable :: roots (:) Root names/bits; overrides must preserve membership represented in file masks. Source Code type watch_feature_t contains procedure :: init => feat_init_noop procedure :: on_start => feat_noop procedure :: on_watch_list_built => feat_list_noop procedure :: on_manifest_changed => feat_manifest_noop procedure :: on_change_detected => feat_change_noop procedure :: on_before_run => feat_before_noop procedure :: on_after_run => feat_after_noop end type watch_feature_t","tags":"","url":"type/watch_feature_t.html"},{"title":"log_field_t – fpm-watch ","text":"type, public :: log_field_t A typed event attribute, stored as its JSON representation. Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial character(len=:), public, allocatable :: key Attribute name ( key ) and its complete serialized JSON representation ( value ). character(len=:), public, allocatable :: value Attribute name ( key ) and its complete serialized JSON representation ( value ). Source Code type log_field_t !> Attribute name (`key`) and its complete serialized JSON representation (`value`). character ( len = :), allocatable :: key , value end type log_field_t","tags":"","url":"type/log_field_t.html"},{"title":"root_info_t – fpm-watch ","text":"type, public :: root_info_t Executable basename and one root bit used for affected-target selection. Graph construction assigns unique bits to up to 64 run/test roots; graphs outside\nthat range return an empty root array and do not support name injection. Inherited by type~~root_info_t~~InheritedByGraph type~root_info_t root_info_t type~watcher_t watcher_t type~watcher_t->type~root_info_t roots Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to the parent type which it\nextends. Dashed arrows point from a derived type to the other\ntypes it contains as a components, with a label listing the name(s) of\nsaid component(s). Where possible, edges connecting nodes are\ngiven different colours to make them easier to distinguish in\nlarge graphs. Components Type Visibility Attributes Name Initial integer(kind=int64), public :: mask = 0_int64 Single bit identifying this root in target and file membership masks. character(len=:), public, allocatable :: name Executable output basename without suffix, used as an fpm target pattern. Source Code type root_info_t !> Executable output basename without suffix, used as an fpm target pattern. character ( len = :), allocatable :: name !> Single bit identifying this root in target and file membership masks. integer ( int64 ) :: mask = 0_int64 end type root_info_t","tags":"","url":"type/root_info_t.html"},{"title":"watch_config_t – fpm-watch ","text":"type, public :: watch_config_t Fully assembled watcher configuration. This record is the primary input to watcher_t%init() . Inherits type~~watch_config_t~~InheritsGraph type~watch_config_t watch_config_t fpm_build_settings fpm_build_settings type~watch_config_t->fpm_build_settings settings type~watch_opts_t watch_opts_t type~watch_config_t->type~watch_opts_t w string_t string_t type~watch_opts_t->string_t ignore, include, enabled_features Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Type Type This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a derived type to t