ity = 1 ) end subroutine print_configuration","tags":"","url":"proc/print_configuration.html"},{"title":"print_file_list – fpm-watch","text":"public  subroutine print_file_list(files, w) Emit up to 200 watch.file records when verbosity is at least 2. Larger lists produce an omitted-count record. Unallocated lists are ignored.\nThe engine calls this at startup only when print_files_once is enabled,\nand after successful refreshes whenever verbosity is at least 2. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type(string_t), intent(in), allocatable :: files (:) type( watch_opts_t ), intent(in) :: w Calls proc~~print_file_list~~CallsGraph proc~print_file_list print_file_list interface~log_int log_int proc~print_file_list->interface~log_int proc~log_event log_event proc~print_file_list->proc~log_event proc~log_string log_string proc~print_file_list->proc~log_string str str proc~print_file_list->str proc~log_default_int log_default_int interface~log_int->proc~log_default_int proc~log_int64 log_int64 interface~log_int->proc~log_int64 proc~format_log_record format_log_record proc~log_event->proc~format_log_record proc~log_timestamp log_timestamp proc~log_event->proc~log_timestamp proc~json_quote json_quote proc~log_string->proc~json_quote proc~format_log_record->proc~json_quote proc~escape_text escape_text proc~format_log_record->proc~escape_text proc~json_quote->proc~escape_text proc~log_default_int->proc~log_int64 proc~utf8_width utf8_width proc~escape_text->proc~utf8_width Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplemen