erbosity = 2 ) end if end subroutine print_file_list","tags":"","url":"proc/print_file_list.html"},{"title":"build_child_command – fpm-watch","text":"private  function build_child_command(exe0, log_format, restart_count) result(cmd) Serialize child argv with a generation counter and the parent's log format. Remove supervisor flags and prior log-format/child markers from the leading\nwatcher options. Preserve other leading values and every forwarded token\nafter the subcommand, quoting each original argv token independently. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name character(len=*), intent(in) :: exe0 character(len=*), intent(in) :: log_format integer, intent(in) :: restart_count Return Value character(len=:), allocatable Calls proc~~build_child_command~~CallsGraph proc~build_child_command build_child_command proc~choose_self_exe choose_self_exe proc~build_child_command->proc~choose_self_exe proc~get_arg get_arg proc~build_child_command->proc~get_arg proc~quote_arg quote_arg proc~build_child_command->proc~quote_arg proc~starts_with starts_with proc~build_child_command->proc~starts_with proc~watch_option_takes_value watch_option_takes_value proc~build_child_command->proc~watch_option_takes_value str str proc~build_child_command->str proc~choose_self_exe->proc~get_arg proc~is_windows is_windows proc~quote_arg->proc~is_windows get_os_type get_os_type proc~is_windows->get_os_type Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Where possible, edges connecting 